From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:45:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): opt-in graceful restart on SIGTERM

gateway.sigterm_restart_wait (false = off): a supervisor's SIGTERM takes
the request_restart path like SIGUSR1, so approvals and clarify stay
answerable and new input is kept for the next owner. A second SIGTERM
stops at once.
